{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parental supervision is overrated!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Alex, a kid who\u2019s itching to explore the nearby ruins while everyone else is busy attending a lecture about\u2026 rocks?! As a mysterious voice calls you into action, unraveling the secrets of The Ruby Chest becomes the only way to go back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/96333f71bae940fe6b22b0bcdd748948.apng?t=1775778169\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/96333f71bae940fe6b22b0bcdd748948.poster.avif?t=1775778169\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"A kid walks alongside a cliff in ancient meso-american ruins.\" width=1170 height=320 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pocket-sized adventure, giant-sized fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out across a world filled with tricky puzzles, mischievous enemies, and retro handheld vibes! Leave no stone unturned (or better yet, unbroken) as you earn new abilities, discover hidden passages, and vandalize a priceless landmark in search of donuts and broccoli. Yep, that\u2019s what kids did when they got lost before cellphones were invented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/dc96677fb3c4ca3b1d373770049f6ccf.apng?t=1775778169\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/dc96677fb3c4ca3b1d373770049f6ccf.poster.avif?t=1775778169\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"The kid finds a whip next to a skeleton wearing an explorer gear inside a tomb.\" width=1170 height=320 /></picture></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But wait, there is more!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore over 5 different regions filled with puzzles and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new equipment to gain game-changing combat abilities and earn access to new areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy vibrant visuals and catchy chiptune music, true to Game Boy Color palette and sound limitations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stickers! Because everything is better with stickers\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/9a711499db603f3293fca45785680651.poster.avif?t=1775778169\" aria-label=\"The kid, now wearing an explorer gear, uses the whip, a hammer and a spear to attack enemies made of stone.\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/9a711499db603f3293fca45785680651.webm?t=1775778169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085040/extras/9a711499db603f3293fca45785680651.mp4?t=1775778169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"87420f4a3beb54fbe23f49c0817488b06ec8c22b.jpg","localized_name":"Right Off the Bat","name":"Right Off the Bat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1085040/87420f4a3beb54fbe23f49c0817488b06ec8c22b.jpg"},{"icon":"e51b368d310222902693fc2d21855d11fbd8993f.jpg","localized_name":"The Underdog","name":"The Underdog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1085040/e51b368d310222902693fc2d21855d11fbd8993f.jpg"},{"icon":"dcaed5f932806ccee5024354a83bafd8843c4b73.jpg","localized_name":"No Alchemistry Between Us","name":"No Alchemistry Between Us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1085040/dcaed5f93